WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.667
-Our next guest has his standup special "Romantic Comedy"

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:06.000
premiering November 11th on HBO Max.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.801
Please welcome the very funny Ian Lara.

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:10.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.567 --> 00:00:17.501
♪♪

00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:20.033
-Oh, man. This is nice. Thank you, guys.

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:21.634
It's really nice to be here.

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:24.300
We're approaching my favorite time of the year --

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.267
dating season.

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:29.067
That wonderful time of the year when everybody except you

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:32.100
is in a happy committed relationship.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.868
I see some of you guys in here tonight.

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:36.000
You know, you guys look good. I'm not here to make fun of you.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.734
I like couples. I want to be in a couple.

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:42.767
My own. I don't want to join your couple.

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:44.400
You got to be clear about that now.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.501
There's people out here be in a happy relationship,

00:00:46.501 --> 00:00:49.601
then they just want other people to join their couple.

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:51.467
There's a word for them. What do you call those people

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:53.033
that want to date multiple partners?

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:54.968
-Throuples! -Men. That's the word.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:57.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:02.100
We started that. They're trying to take it away from us.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.067
We was doing it before it was mainstream.

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:06.467
Women can do it now, too, though, now

00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:07.667
because women are up.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.834
You know, you ladies, you guys --

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:10.200
you control dating now.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.767
Which is fine. I'm not upset. We had a good run.

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:15.901
300,000 years. It was fun.

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:17.501
Y'all got to give us time to adjust now, though.

00:01:17.501 --> 00:01:18.934
A lot of new rules when it comes to dating.

00:01:18.934 --> 00:01:21.567
Like, I just found this out. Did you guys know that women

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:24.200
don't get sad after breakups anymore?

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.701 --> 00:01:27.834
When did this happen?

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:29.501
I thought you broke up with a lady,

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:31.267
she was supposed to be sad.

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:33.200
That's what every R&amp;B song in the '90s

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:35.067
said was gonna happen.

00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:37.000
Y'all remember every Mary J. Blige song

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.067
had a girl crying under a staircase or in a hallway?

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:40.634
That's what I thought was gonna happen

00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:44.467
when I broke up with somebody.

00:01:44.467 --> 00:01:46.167
Because your friends, they'll lie to you.

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:47.901
They'll be like, "Don't worry. She's not going anywhere.

00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:50.634
You got time to figure it out. She'll be right there."

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:52.601
Not anymore.

00:01:52.601 --> 00:01:54.200
You break up with a woman now,

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:57.200
she starts living her best life immediately.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:59.434 --> 00:02:00.868
No. No.

00:02:00.868 --> 00:02:03.300
It's rude. It's rude. I don't like it.

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:04.901
You get into an argument tonight,

00:02:04.901 --> 00:02:06.701
in the morning she's posting from Bali.

00:02:06.701 --> 00:02:10.567
Like, when did you have time...

00:02:10.567 --> 00:02:11.901
to fly to Indonesia?

00:02:11.901 --> 00:02:17.200
I wanted to watch the game. You flew to Indonesia?!

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.234
A friend of mine is going through a breakup,

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:20.501
and she asked me straight-up.

00:02:20.501 --> 00:02:22.501
She was like, "Why are men so immature?"

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:24.267
So I gave her an honest answer. I was like,

00:02:24.267 --> 00:02:26.100
"It's 'cause when it comes to relationships,

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.100
we got to figure this stuff out on our own."

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.367
There's nobody we can speak to.

00:02:29.367 --> 00:02:31.000
That's why it takes us longer. You know?

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.734
It's nice to have somebody you can speak to

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:34.634
when you're going through relationship problems,

00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:36.701
somebody to give you a clear perspective.

00:02:36.701 --> 00:02:40.501
That's nice. Y'all think we don't want that?

00:02:40.501 --> 00:02:43.400
But who we gonna speak to? Men?

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:45.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:49.934
You ever had a good conversation with a man about anything?

00:02:49.934 --> 00:02:52.968
Now really think about that. Juggle your memory.

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:56.868
What was the last time you left a conversation with an adult man

00:02:56.868 --> 00:02:58.300
thinking, "Nah, I'm glad I did that.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.501
He understood exactly what I was talking about."

00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:04.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:04.234 --> 00:03:07.501
"This wasn't a complete waste of time."

00:03:07.501 --> 00:03:09.267
Men don't give good advice.

00:03:09.267 --> 00:03:12.167
I don't care how old you are, no man in here gives good advice.

00:03:12.167 --> 00:03:13.868
And it's not 'cause we're stupid.

00:03:13.868 --> 00:03:16.667
I don't like that narrative. Men are not stupid.

00:03:16.667 --> 00:03:18.267
We're selfish. It's different.

00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:19.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.434 --> 00:03:21.601
We only care about ourselves.

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:23.801
Like, you come talk to me about relationships, I'll talk to you.

00:03:23.801 --> 00:03:25.934
But I'm-a be honest with you. I'm a single guy.

00:03:25.934 --> 00:03:28.534
Single guys, we just want all of our boys to be single with us

00:03:28.534 --> 00:03:30.701
so we can run the town together.

00:03:30.701 --> 00:03:34.634
So you come talk to me, I might ruin your life.

00:03:34.634 --> 00:03:36.901
I'm being honest. Any minor inconvenience,

00:03:36.901 --> 00:03:40.000
I'm like, "Dude, you don't need to be with her.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.100
Those kids are 6 and 7 years old.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:46.000
They're practically adults. Pack your bags.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.434
It's wing night. We're going out.

00:03:48.434 --> 00:03:52.667
You're 47. You're too young to be thinking about a family.

00:03:52.667 --> 00:03:55.234
You have time."

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:56.667
See, women, you guys are good at advice.

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:58.567
'Cause y'all have coaching. Y'all got guidance. You know?

00:03:58.567 --> 00:04:00.100
Y'all going through relationship problems,

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:01.934
y'all get on the phone, you have a whole team of women

00:04:01.934 --> 00:04:05.834
that will take a week off work and move into your apartment.

00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:08.334
Have your living room looking like the Pentagon War Room

00:04:08.334 --> 00:04:10.834
with TV monitors and graphs and charts

00:04:10.834 --> 00:04:13.300
all over the living room so they can dissect every message

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:15.968
he's ever sent to you, ever.

00:04:15.968 --> 00:04:17.734
Then they'll move on to phase two.

00:04:17.734 --> 00:04:23.000
Y'all know what phase two is? It's a brunch.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.934
They'll schedule a small brunch.

00:04:24.934 --> 00:04:27.367
That's what they'll call it. "A small brunch."

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:31.467
67 women will show up to a restaurant.

00:04:31.467 --> 00:04:35.801
On a Sunday afternoon dressed like they going to the Met Gala.

00:04:35.801 --> 00:04:37.634
And that's where the real work gets done.

00:04:37.634 --> 00:04:40.067
They'll decide as a unit. You think they're partying.

00:04:40.067 --> 00:04:42.100
They're not partying. They're having a meeting.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.667
That's what a meeting looks like.

00:04:43.667 --> 00:04:44.834
And that's when they decide

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:46.801
when you text back, when you don't text back,

00:04:46.801 --> 00:04:49.634
when you block him, when you unblock him.

00:04:49.634 --> 00:04:52.501
Now they're so sophisticated, these women,

00:04:52.501 --> 00:04:54.200
they don't even need to ask any questions about him.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.601
They just got to know two things.

00:04:55.601 --> 00:04:57.634
Two things they need to know. That's it.

00:04:57.634 --> 00:05:00.300
When's his birthday and what time he was born.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.834
They can tell you everything you need to know

00:05:02.834 --> 00:05:05.467
about his personality.

00:05:05.467 --> 00:05:06.868
These women don't play fair.

00:05:06.868 --> 00:05:09.834
That's why I always tell men, "Guys, listen, you got to stop

00:05:09.834 --> 00:05:13.534
telling women when your real birthday is."

00:05:13.534 --> 00:05:14.901
I'm serious. They research it.

00:05:14.901 --> 00:05:17.133
They learn everything they need to know about you

00:05:17.133 --> 00:05:18.868
and they'll use it against you.

00:05:18.868 --> 00:05:20.601
Don't tell them. You got to do what I do.

00:05:20.601 --> 00:05:22.167
I don't tell women my real birthday.

00:05:22.167 --> 00:05:23.834
I'll ask you when your birthday is,

00:05:23.834 --> 00:05:25.167
then I'll go on Google

00:05:25.167 --> 00:05:29.434
and I'll look up the best match with your birthday.

00:05:29.434 --> 00:05:31.501
Then I'll pretend that's my birthday.

00:05:31.501 --> 00:05:33.901
Every time we get into an argument, I'm like,

00:05:33.901 --> 00:05:35.267
"I don't know what to tell you.

00:05:35.267 --> 00:05:38.200
The stars say we belong together, so..."

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.100
I'm Ian Lara. You guys have been fantastic.

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:41.567
Thank you, guys.

00:05:41.567 --> 00:05:45.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:45.033 --> 00:05:47.501
-That's the way you do it. That was unbelievable.

00:05:47.501 --> 00:05:50.400
Ian Lara!

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:54.400
"Romantic Comedy" premieres November 11th on HBO Max.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.467
We'll be right back, everybody. Come on back.

